# Build requirements process

# 1. Update the `requirements.in` file with libraries and specify version ranges.
# 2. Install uv if needed: `pip install uv`.
# 3. Compile the platform-neutral requirements by running `uv pip compile requirements.in --universal -o requirements.lock.txt`.

